			"notes": "## This is an unofficial port. If you get any issues with it, please don't annoy Endal; [create a new issue](https://github.com/zvikasdongre/trackwork-fabric/issues) on **this repository** instead. :)\n\nFor now, I am uploading the jar file manually, but it will be automated when I get time, and I'll also probably change the mod ID to not interfere with compatibility mods such as `vmod`, which work on both fabric and forge mod loaders.\n\nThe version's content is 1:1 with what original trackwork has in that version, so trackwork-fabric-1.0.1-beta is equivalent to the original trackwork-1.0.1-beta"
